<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Upon the hill of Zion</l><l>Hath God established Thee</l><l>And all the nations given</l><l>Thy heritage to be.</l><l>To Thee hath God committed</l><l>His full authority</l><l>To rule with might the nations</l><l>Unto eternity.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Before the time of fulness,</l><l>While darkness still prevails,</l><l>Ten thousands daily render</l><l>To Thee their loyal hails!</l><l>From shore to shore Thy people</l><l>To Thee their praises sing;</l><l>They worship, love, and serve Thee</l><l>As their dear Savior-King!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>When in the time appointed</l><l>With glory Thou wilt come,</l><l>The earth with all its nations</l><l>Thy kingdom will become.</l><l>In majesty and splendor</l><l>Wilt Thou be served as King,</l><l>All kindreds and all peoples</l><l>To Thee their praise shall ring!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
